        "created_at": "2025-08-08T17:54:52.059Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am writing to kindly request a rescheduling of my System Commands OPPE exam, currently scheduled for 16th August. I have my MLP OPPE exam on 17th August, and I am also involved in the ongoing viva sessions for the MAD-2 project during this period.</p>\n<p>Given the academic load and overlapping assessments, I would be sincerely grateful if my System Commands OPPE could be rescheduled to 23rd August.</p>\n<p>I can also send my slot allocation photo for further proof.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
